### Expected output

```
novu-client-1   | {"url":"http://cgnat-target:8080/workflow-http-step","addresses":[{"address":"100.64.0.20","family":4}],"validation":"ALLOW"}
cgnat-target-1  | [target] 100.64.0.10 POST /workflow-http-step
